        "id": 1015428
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-02-22T01:15:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So I think this will also send the error when the VPN turned itself off explicitly. Is this intended ? I don\u0027t think this is necessarily a big problem, though I wonder if it\u0027s what we should do. What do you think ?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1057,
        "startChar": 56,
        "endLine": 1057,
        "endChar": 90
      },
      "revId": "2e5eadd1a87354fc8568778fdd360459336c0668",
