      "writtenOn": "2022-03-01T01:56:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As we discussed, there is usually an UI in VPN app for user to deactivate the VPN connection.\nAnd I don\u0027t think there is a easy way to distinguish the VPN connection is deactivated by the VPN app itself or by the user.\nIf the VPN connection is deactivated by the VPN app itself, then I think it should know what\u0027s going on and may ignore the event since it decides deactivating the VPN connection anyway.\nSo I think it\u0027s fine to send the event here.",
